              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eFill each tray, then complete the container once enough trays have gone in.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCheck what you are building\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eNow producing\u003c/span\u003e banner names the part, and \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eComponents at this cell\u003c/span\u003e in the sidebar lists the component LOTs staged for this cell (scanned in on Assembly IN).\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eFill the tray\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eHow a tray closes depends on this line - its closure method (\u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eBy Count\u003c/span\u003e / \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eBy Weight\u003c/span\u003e / \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eBy Vision\u003c/span\u003e) shows near the header; tap it to open \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eChange Closure Mode\u003c/span\u003e if it needs to change. On \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eBy Count\u003c/span\u003e, enter the count in \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eParts in tray\u003c/span\u003e and press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eComplete Tray\u003c/span\u003e when it is full. On \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eBy Weight\u003c/span\u003e or \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eBy Vision\u003c/span\u003e, the scale or camera closes the tray on its own at target - there is nothing to press.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eComplete the container\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eOn a \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eBy Count\u003c/span\u003e line, once enough trays have gone in, press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eComplete\u003c/span\u003e under \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eContainer Completion Gate\u003c/span\u003e to finish and ship it. A single-tray container ships on its own - you will not see the gate for it.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
